  "description": "Document 113 event contract for the events app/modules/lims_integration/commands.py actually emits. 5 of the catalogue's 8 declared Document 24 events are implemented: LIMSSampleRequested, LIMSStatusReceived, LIMSResultAccepted, LIMSResultRevised (mutually exclusive outcomes of the same result-ingestion call site, chosen by is_revision), LIMSReconciliationMismatchDetected. LIMSResultReceived, LIMSResultRejected and LIMSIntegrationDeadLettered are declared but have no producing code path -- a received-but-not-yet-accepted intermediate state, an explicit rejection path, and dead-letter handling for the LIMS adapter are not yet built. Verified directly against source.",
